v35 default arm = `qual_001` (min_charge 2); v38 = min_charge 1 + mobility veto with the 3+ arm dropped.
Extraction on ibminode05 (shared, loaded -- not a timing number): 16:02, 170.1 GB, 3,409,189 spectra
