README.md:92:| `-threads` | all cores | worker threads; an explicit `-threads 1` is honoured. Parallelism is isolation windows × flight-time bands, and the window loop reaches ~72× (30-min) to ~90× (2-hour) thread occupancy at 100 threads; window concurrency is bounded by a free-RAM admission gate, not by core count |
